<section class="faq g-paper">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="faq-top">
      <div class="faq-aside">
        <div class="eyebrow" data-home-reveal><span class="tick">\</span> 08 · Questions</div>
        <h2 data-home-reveal style="--d:60ms">The questions we get first.</h2>
        <div class="faq-ask" data-home-reveal style="--d:180ms">
          <p class="faq-ask-q">Didn’t see yours?</p>
          <a href="#start">Ask us anything <span class="ar" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-list hm-faq" data-home-reveal style="--d:120ms">
        <details class="faq-item" open>
          <summary class="faq-q"
            ><span>How is this different from an agency or RPO?</span><span class="faq-ic" aria-hidden="true"
            ></span></summary
          ><div class="faq-a">
            <div>
              <p>
                An agency sends CVs for you to screen. Recruitment process outsourcing (RPO) runs your recruiting for
                you. We interview first, so your team only meets people who cleared the bar.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-q"><span>What does it cost?</span><span class="faq-ic" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary
          ><div class="faq-a">
            <div>
              <p>
                For recruitment, a percentage of the hire’s annual CTC, due only when you hire. Some clients prefer a
                monthly retainer with a Tribera recruiter working inside their team. For interview as a service, a fee
                per interview, plus a success fee if you hire from our shortlist. We quote for the role after the first
                call.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-q"
            ><span>What if a hire leaves early?</span><span class="faq-ic" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary
          ><div class="faq-a">
            <div>
              <p>
                If someone we placed leaves early, we run the search again at no cost. The replacement period is written
                into your agreement.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-q"
            ><span>Which roles and industries do you cover?</span><span class="faq-ic" aria-hidden="true"
            ></span></summary
          ><div class="faq-a">
            <div>
              <p>
                Senior technical and specialist roles in financial services, technology and SaaS, AI and data,
                cybersecurity, healthcare, manufacturing and global capability centres. If we can’t cover one, we tell
                you on the first call.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-q"
            ><span>Can our own interviewers run the final round?</span><span class="faq-ic" aria-hidden="true"
            ></span></summary
          ><div class="faq-a">
            <div><p>Yes. Your panel runs the final round, or one of our interviewers runs it for you.</p></div>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-q"
            ><span>Do candidates know they are recorded?</span><span class="faq-ic" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary
          ><div class="faq-a">
            <div>
              <p>
                Yes. Every candidate agrees to the recording before the interview starts. If someone says no, we don’t
                interview them.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-q"
            ><span>Is our candidate data safe?</span><span class="faq-ic" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary
          ><div class="faq-a">
            <div>
              <p>
                It is encrypted, stored in India, kept on your terms and deleted on request. We log every access, record
                consent, sign a DPA and complete your security review.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
      <button class="hm-more" hidden type="button" aria-expanded="false">Show all questions</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
